        "text": ".Fl Fl prefix Ar backup-prefix"
      },
      {
        "line": 98,
        "text": "Causes the next argument to be interpreted as a prefix to the backup file"
      },
      {
        "line": 103,
        "text": ".It Fl b , Fl Fl backup"
      },
      {
        "line": 104,
        "text": "Save a backup copy of the file before it is modified."
      },
      {
        "line": 105,
        "text": "By default the original file is saved with a backup extension of"
      },
      {
